      "align": "start"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Here's the big lesson from Ghar Soaps:",
      "x": 324,
      "y": 7113,
      "w": 793,
      "h": 56,
      "size": "20px",
      "weight": "400",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)",
      "ls": "-0.3px",
      "align": "start"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "If you're investing in influencer marketing, don't let that content live only on social media.",
      "x": 324,
      "y": 7169,
      "w": 793,
      "h": 84,
      "size": "20px",
      "weight": "400",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)",
      "ls": "-0.3px",
      "align": "start"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Bring it into your store. Put it on your product pages. Let it work where purchase decisions actually happen.",
      "x": 324,
      "y": 7253,
      "w": 793,
      "h": 56,
      "size": "20px",
      "weight": "400",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)",
      "ls": "-0.3px",
      "align": "start"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Most brands think of their product page as separate from their marketing. But for the customer, it's all one experience.",
      "x": 324,
      "y": 7309,
      "w": 793,
      "h": 56,
      "size": "20px",
      "weight": "400",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)",
      "ls": "-0.3px",
      "align": "start"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "When someone lands on your product page after seeing an influencer's post, they should feel continuity - not disconnection.",
      "x": 324,
      "y": 7365,
      "w": 793,
      "h": 56,
      "size": "20px",
      "weight": "400",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)",
      "ls": "-0.3px",
      "align": "start"
    },
